## 1. `dim_demographic_slicer`

Controls which demographic attribute the breakdown visual uses.
Paste as **Modeling → New Table**.

```dax
dim_demographic_slicer =
DATATABLE(
    "DemoKey",   STRING,
    "DemoLabel", STRING,
    "SortOrder", INTEGER,
    {
        { "vic_sex",  "Victim Sex",          1 },
        { "vic_race", "Victim Race",         2 },
        { "vic_age",  "Victim Age Group",    3 },
        { "off_sex",  "Offender Sex",        4 },
        { "off_race", "Offender Race",       5 },
        { "off_age",  "Offender Age Group",  6 }
    }
)
```

Slicer config: field = `DemoLabel`, sort by `SortOrder`, **single-select**.

