## 9. `dim_county` Bridge Table

Needed only for [Crime_Per_100k]. Creates a mapping from the 3-digit `county_fips`
in the crime fact table to the full ACS `geo_id` format (e.g. `"0500000US55025"`).

```dax
dim_county =
SELECTCOLUMNS(
    FILTER(
        DISTINCT(
            SELECTCOLUMNS(fact_crime_wi_county, "county_fips", fact_crime_wi_county[county_fips])
        ),
        NOT ISBLANK([county_fips])
    ),
    "county_fips", [county_fips],
    "geo_id", "0500000US55" & [county_fips]
)
